  displayName: Asphalt Roads
  description: Blow the column's heavy residue into bitumen, bind it with sand and
    crushed aggregate, and lay it. A paved strip is faster on foot, grips better
    under wheels and lets a route become a schedule - and it wears out under traffic,
    so it wants repairing with the same hot mix.
